59
00:01:56.833 --> 00:01:59.200
basically what do you want co pilot to do

60
00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:01.766
the best approach here is just to pick one verb

61
00:02:01.766 --> 00:02:03.300
stated as plainly as possible

62
00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:06.033
keep it super simple summarize draft

63
00:02:06.033 --> 00:02:07.300
find compare

