think about it a summary

74
00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:31.766
you're prepping for your manager's weekly update

75
00:02:31.766 --> 00:02:34.433
needs a vastly different tone than a quick summary

76
00:02:34.433 --> 00:02:35.200
you're just throwing into

77
00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:36.966
your own personal notes right

78
00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:40.633
adding context tells copilot exactly how formal to be

79
00:02:40.633 --> 00:02:43.233
how concise to make it and most importantly

80
00:02:43.233 --> 00:02:44.833
